{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_087AF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"身份暴露了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"虽然<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>和我真正的目的还没有暴露，但他们已经知道我是特工了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"一刻也不能再等。现在只能立刻执行计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我必须完成自己的使命……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到底为什么会变成这样……。明明只差三天，再给我三天就够了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Miller的歌也已经写好了。《恋之抑止力》——一首关于无法坦率表达感情的女孩的苦涩情歌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我也练习过了。即使唱不到真正歌手的水平，我也有信心好好唱完。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"可偏偏……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"说到底，都是因为<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>已经完成的消息泄露给了<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\", \"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Mother Base里一定还有除了我以外，与<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>有联系的人。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"把组织的力量像网一样铺开，不给个人意志留下介入的空隙——这的确像是他们会做的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"得知<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>已经完成后，他们便催促我尽快执行作战。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"为了平安迎来和平日，我只能制造一个无法执行计划的理由。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"所以，我试图破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"只要让驱动系统之类的地方出故障，制造出不得不延期计划的理由……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"抱着这个想法，我等到深夜，偷偷潜进了机库。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"如果被发现是人为破坏，又会惹出麻烦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"我小心挑选了驱动系统中容易承受负荷的部位，试图让零件发生变形。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"步行机械的驱动系统要求极高的加工精度。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"哪怕只有一点点变形，也应该足以成为推迟计划的理由。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"可是，我的破坏行动被Chico撞见了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"他是不是又睡不着，在外面乱晃？看到我搞破坏，Chico又惊讶又害怕。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"如果我真想杀他，本来应该做得到。可我就是开不了枪！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"我知道Chico喜欢我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":26,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"虽然我对那种小孩子根本没兴趣……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"可是面对他那小小的背影，我一时就是扣不下扳机。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"Chico会把这件事告诉别人吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"要是他愿意袒护我，什么也不对别人说……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"……不行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"他应该已经明白了……我根本不是Chico以为的那种女孩。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"他连缘由都没问就逃走了，一定已经对我失望了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"如果大家知道我是特工，我就不可能再维持以前那样的关系。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"而且……如果除了我之外，还有别人和<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>相通……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"那我试图破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的事，也会传到<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>那里……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\", \"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"对我来说，这里已经不再是<R=天堂,HEAVEN>了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=天堂,HEAVEN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"……果然，只能现在立刻行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"Chico撞见我时，破坏还没有完成，所以<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>还能动。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"也许它发挥不出原本的力量和速度，但已经没有时间修理了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"不驾驶<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，我就没有胜算。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"必须在Chico去叫人之前抢先行动……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"反正，这本来就是迟早必须做的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"只不过……比原定计划稍微提前了一点而已……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"……走吧，<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"Metal Gear <R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，启动——。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}